## 1. Longform — fix the break (highest priority; it's been down a while)

- [~] **Run the diagnostic to find the cause.** Drop `run-longform-diagnostic.cjs` beside the real script and run `node run-longform-diagnostic.cjs hume "test subject"` from PowerShell. It reports the exact failure instead of swallowing it.
  - Likely causes, ranked: (a) OpenRouter out of credits [HTTP 402]; (b) model slug `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6` retired/renamed [404]; (c) `openrouter.ai` blocked by allowlist/sandbox [network ENOTFOUND/ECONNREFUSED]; (d) bad/expired key [401].
- [ ] **Apply the fix the diagnostic points to**, then confirm a clean run end-to-end (episode HTML written + `longform/index.html` card inserted).
